# 3. QA Tasks Before Releasing a Movie Booking Feature

**Feature:** New movie booking feature in a BookMyShow-style app.

### 1. Test the complete booking flow

QA should test movie search, theatre selection, show-time selection, seat selection, booking and confirmation.

**Expected:** The user should be able to complete a booking without errors.

### 2. Test different payment methods

Test supported payment options such as UPI, cards and other available methods.

**Expected:** Payment should work correctly and the booking should be confirmed only after successful payment.

### 3. Perform regression testing

Check existing features such as movie search, booking history, cancellation and notifications.

**Expected:** The new feature should not break existing functionality.

### 4. Perform performance testing

Check how the feature behaves when many users try to book tickets at the same time, especially for a popular movie.

**Expected:** The application should remain stable and respond within an acceptable time.

### 5. Perform compatibility and usability testing

Test the feature on supported mobile devices, browsers and operating systems. Also check whether buttons, seat selection and payment information are easy to understand.

**Expected:** The feature should work consistently and be easy for users to navigate.

